    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">SEcure Neighbor Discovery (SEND) defines the Name Type field in the
ICMPv6 Trust Anchor option.  This document specifies new Name Type
fields based on certificate Subject Key Identifiers (SKIs).</t>
    </abstract>
